{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLDVx3gcSS5RGoHXaUQNzf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# kiln-scheduler\n2\t\n3\tPlaces queued CI jobs on Kiln's runner fleet.\n4\t\n5\t- `src/fairshare.ts` - each org's share of the fleet, from its plan's weight\n6\t- `src/lease.ts` - a claimed job holds a lease and renews it while it runs\n7\t- `src/contracts.ts` - per-org concurrency contracts\n8\t- `src/alerts.ts` - paging rules for the dispatcher\n9\t- `src/ratelimit.ts` - rate-limit headers on the API's 429s\n10\t- `src/boot.ts` - how a runner gets ready for its first job\n11\t- `src/metrics.ts` - gauges the dashboard reads\n12\t- `src/deploy.ts` - the deploy bot's guard\n13\t- `src/audit.ts` - audit entries for admin actions\n14\t\n15\t`npm test` runs the tests. Node 22+ runs the TypeScript directly.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90c1159c-c94f-4210-904e-3a75c7064ba7","uuid":"cc78126a-b3ca-4b4c-a38f-bc1d0f2cb732","timestamp":"2026-11-17T05:56:59.917Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"<run>/repo/README.md","content":"# kiln-scheduler\n\nPlaces queued CI jobs on Kiln's runner fleet.\n\n- `src/fairshare.ts` - each org's share of the fleet, from its plan's weight\n- `src/lease.ts` - a claimed job holds a lease and renews it while it runs\n- `src/contracts.ts` - per-org concurrency contracts\n- `src/alerts.ts` - paging rules for the dispatcher\n- `src/ratelimit.ts` - rate-limit headers on the API's 429s\n- `src/boot.ts` - how a runner gets ready for its first job\n- `src/metrics.ts` - gauges the dashboard reads\n- `src/deploy.ts` - the deploy bot's guard\n- `src/audit.ts` - audit entries for admin actions\n\n`npm test` runs the tests. Node 22+ runs the TypeScript directly.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FLDVx3gcSS5RGoHXaUQNzf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
